      "seed": 387329161,
      "version": 510,
      "versionNonce": 1316646889,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1795639810773,
      "created": 1795635764845,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "When processing Request, target might\nexecute CGI Call.\n\nConfig example:\n\nlocation /cgi-bin/ {\n    allow_methods GET POST;\n\n    cgi on;\n    cgi_extension .py;\n    cgi_interpreter /usr/bin/python3;\n}\n\nIn this case, any .py file in /cgi-bin/ is a CGI\nCall and the interpreter is /usr/bin/python3.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "E7WkEFdkGby0y6R3kg5Pu",
      "originalText": "When processing Request, target might execute CGI Call.\n\nConfig example:\n\nlocation /cgi-bin/ {\n    allow_methods GET POST;\n\n    cgi on;\n    cgi_extension .py;\n    cgi_interpreter /usr/bin/python3;\n}\n\nIn this case, any .py file in /cgi-bin/ is a CGI Call and the interpreter is /usr/bin/python3.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
